==Battleground==
*8 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 12~16.67 seconds<sup>360f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 12~16.67 seconds<sup>360f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 37.33~48 seconds<sup>1,120f~1,440f</sup>.
*4 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Cats with a rapid attack speed such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]], can quickly damage Metal Hippoe, who is only at 100% here. Any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critters]], such as [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], can also take it out in a single crit. With it gone, this stage is too easy to lose.

